  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-06-06T19:25:00.759Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It'd be really nice if I was not forced to use the finger tracking on my index controllers. While finger tracking is neat, I'd rather my hands didn't look terribly unnatural like they were constantly holding controllers and I do not like the way the gesture system is set up. It would be nice to give us the option to enable/disable finger tracking and just have the controllers work like any other controllers currently do.",
